#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:2
msgid "Adding and Removing Hosts"
msgstr "Adding y Removing Hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:5
msgid "Adding a Host to an Existing Cluster"
msgstr "Adding un Host a un Existente Clúster"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:7
msgid ""
"Hosts can be added to an existing HVM 1.3 cluster to increase compute "
"capacity or improve failure tolerance."
msgstr ""
"Hosts se puede agregar a un existente HVM 1.3 cluster a increase compute "
"capacidad o improve fallo tolerance."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:10
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:108
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Requisitos previos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:12
msgid "Before adding a new host:"
msgstr "Antes de adding un nuevo host:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:14
msgid ""
"The new host meets all requirements listed in :doc:`building_clusters` (OS, "
"CPU, memory, network, storage)"
msgstr ""
"El nuevo host meets todos requisitos listed en :doc:`building_clusters` (OS,"
" CPU, memoria, network, storage)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:15
msgid ""
"The new host has network connectivity to all existing cluster hosts on port "
"7443"
msgstr ""
"El nuevo host tiene network connectivity a todos existente cluster hosts en "
"puerto 7443"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:16
msgid "Shared storage (iSCSI targets) is accessible from the new host"
msgstr "Shared storage (iSCSI targets) es accessible desde el nuevo host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:17
msgid "Sufficient license capacity is available"
msgstr "Sufficient license capacidad está disponible"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:20
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:117
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "Procedure"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:22
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster]``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster]``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:23
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ Add Worker`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ Add Worker`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:24
msgid "Provide the new host's SSH IP, hostname, and credentials"
msgstr "Proporcionar el nuevo host's SSH IP, hostname, y credentials"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:25
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Complete`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`Complete`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:28
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:126
msgid "What Happens Automatically"
msgstr "Qué Happens Automatically"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:30
msgid ""
"When a host is added to an existing HVM 1.3 cluster, |morpheus| performs the"
" following automated operations:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando un host es agregado a un existente HVM 1.3 cluster, |morpheus| "
"performs lo siguiente automated operaciones:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Package installation and host preparation** — The same provisioning phases"
" run as during initial cluster creation (KVM, Corosync, DLM, OVS networking,"
" firewall, libvirt)"
msgstr ""
"**Package installation and host preparation** — El mismo provisioning phases"
" ejecutar como durante initial cluster creation (KVM, Corosync, DLM, OVS "
"networking, firewall, libvirt)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Corosync authkey distribution** — The cluster's Corosync authentication "
"key is retrieved from Cypher and installed on the new host"
msgstr ""
"**Corosync authkey distribution** — El cluster's Corosync autenticación "
"clave es retrieved desde Cypher y instalado en el nuevo host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Corosync configuration update** — The new host's node block is added to "
"``corosync.conf`` on all existing hosts, the ``config_version`` is "
"incremented, and ``corosync-cfgtool -R`` is run on each host to reload the "
"configuration live (no restart required)"
msgstr ""
"**Corosync configuración update** — El nuevo host's nodo bloquear es "
"agregado a ``corosync.conf`` en todos existente hosts, el ``config_version``"
" es incremented, y ``corosync-cfgtool -R`` es ejecutar en cada host a reload"
" el configuración live (no reiniciar requerido)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:38
msgid ""
"**DLM join** — The new host joins the DLM cluster and gains access to "
"existing lockspaces"
msgstr ""
"**DLM join** — El nuevo host joins el DLM cluster y gains acceso a existente"
" lockspaces"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:40
msgid ""
"**GFS2 journal addition** — For each HPE Clustered Datastore (Shared LUN), a"
" new journal is added using ``gfs2_jadd`` if the current journal count is "
"less than the new total node count"
msgstr ""
"**GFS2 journal addition** — Para cada HPE Clustered Almacén de datos (Shared"
" LUN), un nuevo journal es agregado usando ``gfs2_jadd`` si el actual "
"journal cantidad es menos de el nuevo total nodo cantidad"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:42
msgid ""
"**iSCSI target discovery** — All configured iSCSI targets are discovered and"
" auto-logged-in on the new host"
msgstr ""
"**iSCSI target discovery** — Todos configurado iSCSI targets son discovered "
"y auto-logged-en en el nuevo host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Quorum list update** — |morpheus| sends updated ``quorumInfo`` to all "
"agents in the cluster (including the new host). Each agent persists the "
"updated member list to ``.quorum-nodes`` and begins peer-to-peer quorum "
"pinging with the new host"
msgstr ""
"**Quorum list update** — |morpheus| sends actualizado ``quorumInfo`` a todos"
" agents en el cluster (incluyendo el nuevo host). Cada agent persists el "
"actualizado miembro lista a ``.quorum-nodes`` y begins peer-a-peer quorum "
"pinging con el nuevo host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Storage pool creation** — libvirt storage pools are created on the new "
"host for each existing datastore"
msgstr ""
"**Almacenamiento pool creation** — libvirt storage pools son creado en el "
"nuevo host para cada existente datastore"

