#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:78
msgid ""
"Adding a 4th host to a 3-node cluster increases the majority requirement "
"from 2 to 3 without improving failure tolerance. Consider adding hosts in "
"pairs (3→5, 5→7) for optimal availability."
msgstr ""
"Adding un 4th host a un 3-nodo cluster increases el majority requirement "
"desde 2 a 3 sin improving fallo tolerance. Consider adding hosts en pairs "
"(3→5, 5→7) para optimal disponibilidad."

