#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:101
msgid "Removing a Host from an Existing Cluster"
msgstr "Removing un Host desde un Existente Clúster"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:103
msgid ""
"Hosts can be removed from an HVM 1.3 cluster when decommissioning hardware, "
"reducing cluster size, or replacing failed nodes."
msgstr ""
"Hosts se puede eliminar desde un HVM 1.3 cluster cuando decommissioning "
"hardware, reducing cluster tamaño, o replacing falló nodos."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:105
msgid ""
"Removing a host reduces the cluster's failure tolerance. Ensure the "
"remaining cluster size still meets your availability requirements before "
"proceeding."
msgstr ""
"Removing un host reduces el cluster's fallo tolerance. Asegurar el remaining"
" cluster tamaño todavía meets su disponibilidad requisitos antes de "
"proceeding."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:110
msgid "Before removing a host:"
msgstr "Antes de removing un host:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:112
msgid ""
"Ensure the resulting cluster will still have quorum (at minimum 3 nodes for "
"a single-site cluster)"
msgstr ""
"Asegurar el resulting cluster será todavía tienen quorum (en mínimo 3 nodos "
"para un single-site cluster)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:113
msgid ""
"Evacuate all VMs from the host using maintenance mode (see "
":doc:`host_maintenance`)"
msgstr ""
"Evacuate todos VMs desde el host usando mantenimiento modo (ver "
":doc:`host_maintenance`)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:114
msgid "Verify no VMs are pinned to the host that cannot be moved"
msgstr "Verificar no VMs son pinned al host ese cannot be moved"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:119
msgid ""
"Place the host in maintenance mode to evacuate VMs (see "
":doc:`host_maintenance`)"
msgstr ""
"Place el host en mantenimiento modo a evacuate VMs (ver "
":doc:`host_maintenance`)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:120
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Hosts``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Hosts``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:121
msgid "Select the host to remove"
msgstr "Seleccionar el host a eliminar"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:122
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Remove` or :guilabel:`Delete`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`Eliminar` o :guilabel:`Eliminar`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:123
msgid "Confirm the removal"
msgstr "Confirmar el removal"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:128
msgid ""
"When a host is removed from an HVM 1.3 cluster, |morpheus| performs the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando un host es eliminado desde un HVM 1.3 cluster, |morpheus| performs lo"
" siguiente:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:130
msgid ""
"**GFS2 unmount** — All HPE Clustered Datastores (GFS2 filesystems) are "
"unmounted on the departing host"
msgstr ""
"**GFS2 unmount** — Todos HPE Clustered Almacenes de datos (GFS2 filesystems)"
" son unmounted en el departing host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:132
msgid ""
"**Cluster services stop** — DLM and Corosync are stopped and disabled on the"
" departing host"
msgstr ""
"**Clúster servicios stop** — DLM y Corosync son detenido y deshabilitado en "
"el departing host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:134
msgid ""
"**Corosync configuration update** — The departing host's node block is "
"removed from ``corosync.conf`` on all remaining hosts. The configuration is "
"archived (backed up to ``/etc/corosync/archive/``), ``config_version`` is "
"incremented, and ``corosync-cfgtool -R`` reloads the configuration live on "
"each remaining host"
msgstr ""
"**Corosync configuración update** — El departing host's nodo bloquear es "
"eliminado desde ``corosync.conf`` en todos remaining hosts. El configuración"
" es archived (backed hasta ``/etc/corosync/archive/``), ``config_version`` "
"es incremented, y ``corosync-cfgtool -R`` reloads el configuración live en "
"cada remaining host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:136
msgid ""
"**Datastore cleanup** — Each datastore's location reference to the removed "
"host is cleaned up"
msgstr ""
"**Almacén de datos cleanup** — Cada datastore's location reference al "
"eliminado host es cleaned up"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:138
msgid ""
"**Quorum list update** — Updated ``quorumInfo`` is sent to all remaining "
"agents. The departing host is removed from ``.quorum-nodes`` on all cluster "
"members"
msgstr ""
"**Quorum list update** — Actualizado ``quorumInfo`` es sent a todos "
"remaining agents. El departing host es eliminado desde ``.quorum-nodes`` en "
"todos cluster miembros"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:141
msgid "Quorum Impact When Removing"
msgstr "Quorum Impact Cuando Removing"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:165
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:168
msgid ""
"Never reduce a single-site cluster below 3 nodes. A 2-node cluster cannot "
"achieve quorum if either node fails, resulting in a complete cluster outage."
msgstr ""
"Nunca reduce un single-site cluster a continuación 3 nodos. Un 2-nodo "
"cluster cannot achieve quorum si cualquiera nodo falla, resulting en un "
"completo cluster outage."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:171
msgid "Handling Offline Host Removal"
msgstr "Handling Offline Host Removal"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:173
msgid "If the host to be removed is offline (powered off or unreachable):"
msgstr "Si el host a be eliminado es offline (powered off o unreachable):"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:175
msgid ""
"|morpheus| will perform the Corosync configuration update and quorum list "
"update on the remaining online hosts only"
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| será perform el Corosync configuración update y quorum lista "
"update en el remaining online hosts solo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:176
msgid ""
"The departing host does not need to be reachable for removal to succeed"
msgstr ""
"El departing host does no necesita a be reachable para removal a succeed"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:177
msgid ""
"If no other hosts are online, |morpheus| will retry the removal for up to "
"one hour before raising an alarm"
msgstr ""
"Si no otro hosts son online, |morpheus| será retry el removal para hasta one"
" hour antes de raising un alarm"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:179
msgid ""
"After removing a failed host, the remaining cluster will automatically "
"recalculate quorum based on the new member count. VMs that were running on "
"the removed host will have already been failed over (if the host was offline"
" for longer than 140 seconds)."
msgstr ""
"Después de removing un falló host, el remaining cluster será automáticamente"
" recalculate quorum basado en el nuevo miembro cantidad. VMs ese fueron "
"ejecutando en el eliminado host será tienen ya been falló sobre (si el host "
"fue offline para longer than 140 seconds)."
